{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "%lldつの岸を漂って": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drifted across %lld shores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldつの岸を漂って届いた投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A post that drifted across %lld shores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld歳以上です": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I am %lld or older"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DriftSonar は端末同士が直接つながる、サーバーを持たない SNS です。投稿の中央監視は行われないため、健全な利用は一人ひとりの行動と端末側の機能で守られます。ご利用の前に以下に同意してください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DriftSonar is a serverless social app where devices connect directly. There is no central moderation of posts, so a healthy space depends on each person's conduct and the on-device tools. Please agree to the following before you begin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「同意して始める」を押すと、上記の利用規約と禁止事項、および%lld歳以上であることの確認に同意したものとみなされます。違反した場合、当該コンテンツの非表示やブロックの対象となります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By tapping “Agree and Start,” you agree to the terms and prohibitions above and confirm that you are %lld or older. Violations may result in the content being hidden or blocked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとで設定からいつでも変更できます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can change this anytime in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと約%lld分で消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disappears in about %lld minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと約%lld時間で消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disappears in about %lld hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたにまっすぐ届いた投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A post that reached you directly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Posts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いま、波間に流したいことは？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What do you want to set adrift?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このボトルには収まりきらないようです。短い動画や小さめの画像でもう一度お試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This won't fit in the bottle. Try a shorter video or a smaller image."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このユーザーをブロック": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Block This User"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この形式のメディアはまだ流せません。別のファイルをお試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This media format can't be set adrift yet. Try another file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この投稿を通報": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Report This Post"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ご利用にあたって": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before You Begin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ何も流れ着いていません": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing has drifted ashore yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ誰の投稿も流れ着いていません。近くで誰かが DriftSonar を開くまで、あなたの漂流を映しています。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing has drifted ashore yet. Until someone nearby opens DriftSonar, this shows your own drift."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まっすぐ届いた": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reached you directly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まもなく消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disappearing soon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "システムに合わせる": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use System Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "タイムライン": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Timeline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "テキストをコピー": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ブロックできます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You Can Block"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プロフィール": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ボトルに入りきらないようです。あと%lld文字だけ短くしてみましょう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It won't fit in the bottle. Try shortening it by just %lld characters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ボトルに入る動画は%lld本まで。1本だけ選び直してみましょう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bottle holds up to %lld video. Try picking just one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ボトルに入る画像は%lld枚まで。少し減らしてみましょう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bottle holds up to %lld images. Try removing a few."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メディアをうまく載せられませんでした。もう一度お試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't attach the media. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メディアを削除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove media"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メディアを読み込めませんでした。別のファイルをお試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't load the media. Try another file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "レーダー": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Radar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不適切なコンテンツの禁止": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Objectionable Content"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不適切な投稿は「通報」でこの端末から即座に非表示にできます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can hide an inappropriate post from this device instantly by reporting it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写真・動画を追加": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add photo or video"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "利用規約・コミュニティガイドライン": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terms & Community Guidelines"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匿名": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anonymous"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匿名で流す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send anonymously"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同意して始める": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agree and Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名前を伏せて流します。誰の手紙かは、届いた先でも分かりません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sent without your name. No one downstream can tell whose letter it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "変更は即時に反映され、再起動後も保持されます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes take effect immediately and are kept after you relaunch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "嫌がらせ・脅迫・差別・わいせつ・違法な内容など、不快・不適切な投稿は固く禁止します。これはテキストだけでなく、添付する画像・動画にも等しく適用されます。これらに対して一切の許容はありません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Harassment, threats, discrimination, obscenity, illegal content, and any other objectionable or inappropriate posts are strictly prohibited. This applies equally to text and to attached images and videos. There is zero tolerance for such content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手紙を流す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send a Letter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文字数が%lld文字超過しています": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over the limit by %lld characters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新規投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New Post"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "明らかな不適切語を含む投稿は自動的に伏せ字で表示されます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Posts containing clearly inappropriate words are automatically masked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本アプリは%lld歳以上の方のみご利用いただけます。%lld歳以上であることを確認します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app is only for people aged %lld or older. I confirm that I am %lld or older."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残り%lld文字": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld characters left"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "流す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添付動画": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attached video"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添付画像": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attached image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画像と動画は同じボトルに入りません。どちらかだけにしてみましょう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Images and videos can't share a bottle. Try just one kind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動フィルタ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic Filter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示言語": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示言語を選んでください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Your Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近くで誰かが DriftSonar を開くと\nその投稿が波に乗って流れ着きます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When someone nearby opens DriftSonar,\ntheir posts ride the waves and drift to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迷惑なユーザーはブロックすると、その相手の投稿が即座にすべて非表示になります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blocking a troublesome user instantly hides all of their posts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通報した投稿はこの端末で即座に非表示になります。投稿者をまとめて非表示にするにはブロックをご利用ください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A reported post is hidden immediately on this device. To hide everything from a poster at once, use Block."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通報できます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You Can Report"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
